				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				250b
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. μεγάλοισι τέλεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					560e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> in Magic,
				<i>endow</i> a thing <i>with potency, consecrate</i> it, <i><span class="en">
